  "body": "## v0.6.0\r\n\r\n### What's new\r\n- **Redesign by Juxtopposed**, a whole new look next to Modern and Classic (Settings › Interface › Look):\r\n  - **Dark and Light** themes (Settings › Interface › Theme)\r\n  - **Choose your look again**: the first time v0.6 starts, you can pick Modern, Redesign by Juxtopposed or Classic (once)\r\n- **Equalizer bands**: Preamp and 10 bands from 31 Hz to 16 kHz, −20 to +20 dB each. Pick a preset, then move any band: it becomes your own Custom sound, saved\r\n- **Volume on the player bar**: move to the speaker, \r\n  - ↑ ↓ change it, ✕ mutes\r\n- **Controller vibration**: when you switch tabs, change settings, change the volume,\r\n  -  Turn it off in Settings › Interface › Controller vibration\r\n\r\n### Changed\r\n- In Modern and Classic, the Audio button on the player bar has a new icon (the speaker is now the volume)",
